{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And their children, who do not know, shall hear and learn</b> — these are the little ones, for they will hear and ask, and the fathers will accustom them and guide them, since these little ones are not nursing infants, but rather young children of an age close to being trained. And this is the meaning of <b>and shall learn to fear</b> — in the future, for above it says \"and shall learn and fear.\" But our Sages said (Hagigah 3a): the men come to learn and the women to hear — and the little ones, why do they come? To give reward to those who bring them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T02:57:11.123472722Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}